  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Entrepreneurial skills include understanding customers, selling, handling money, organising work and recovering from setbacks, and the best way to build them is by running small real tests.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
